WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A potassium manganate(VII) crystal dissolves in cold, still water.
Purple colour is concentrated near the crystal.

00:06.000 --> 00:26.250
Dissolved particles spread from higher to lower concentration by diffusion.
No stirring or heating is used.

00:26.250 --> 00:30.000
The solution becomes uniformly purple.
Particles continue moving randomly.
